      exploreCatalog: 'Explore Collection',
      discoverProcess: 'The Artisanal Ritual',
      quote: '“A cigar is not merely tobacco and ember; it is encapsulated time, blessed earth, and the sacred touch of hands that devote lifetimes to perfection.”',
