      highlightTitle: 'Featured Releases',
      highlightSubtitle: 'Masterfully aged creations with international accolades exceeding 93 rating points.',
      terroirText: 'The historic soils of São Félix along the Paraguaçu River possess the optimal microclimate and mineral richness for the legendary Mata Fina leaf — acclaimed globally for its natural sweetness and velvet aroma.',
      pairingBannerTitle: 'Sommelier & Pairings',
      pairingBannerDesc: 'Discover how to pair our fine cigars with rare single malts, artisanal specialty coffee, and aged cognacs.',
